Output docs/demos/gifs/02-code-review.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 680
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "bash docs/demos/lib/cf-sim.sh docs/demos/scripts/02-code-review.txt" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 18s
